WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:18.552
"Settle down, students!"

2
00:00:18.872 --> 00:00:19.933
Mr. Freaky said.

3
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.014
"The assembly is about to start!

4
00:00:22.495 --> 00:00:23.776
Please sit down!"

5
00:00:25.097 --> 00:00:29.320
Ben quickly found Winnie and some other friends inside the crowded auditorium.

6
00:00:31.316 --> 00:00:34.097
As he sat down, he saw some buckets onstage.

7
00:00:35.817 --> 00:00:38.178
Mr. Freaky walked over to speak to Mr.

8
00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:41.639
Bog, the school custodian, who was mopping up puddles.

9
00:00:41.659 --> 00:00:43.980
"What happened here?"

10
00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.140
Ben asked.

11
00:00:45.681 --> 00:00:46.541
Winnie sighed.

12
00:00:46.561 --> 00:00:49.462
"It rained last night.

13
00:00:49.702 --> 00:00:51.482
So the roof is leaking again."

14
00:00:51.502 --> 00:00:54.043
"Are they ever going to fix it?"

15
00:00:54.423 --> 00:00:55.184
Ben asked.

16
00:00:57.108 --> 00:01:02.550
"Maybe after they fix the heat and paint some of the classrooms," Winnie replied, making a face.

17
00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:07.251
Mr. Freaky tripped on a bucket as he walked back toward the microphone.

18
00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:11.052
"Don't worry about the leaky roof, students.

19
00:01:11.672 --> 00:01:14.913
Our Career Day assembly will start in exactly three minutes."

20
00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:17.814
"I love Career Day!"

21
00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:19.154
Mog exclaimed.

22
00:01:19.874 --> 00:01:20.614
Ben laughed.

23
00:01:23.335 --> 00:01:26.416
He knew why Mog liked graveyard hockey and slug cakes.

24
00:01:28.716 --> 00:01:32.219
But he wasn't sure why Mog was so enthusiastic about Career Day.

25
00:01:32.239 --> 00:01:35.161
"What do you want to be when you grow up, Mog?"

26
00:01:35.442 --> 00:01:36.242
Gaby asked.

27
00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.964
"I don't know," Mog said.

28
00:01:38.984 --> 00:01:41.146
"That's why I like hearing about jobs.

29
00:01:41.947 --> 00:01:52.495
I could be anything—a firefighter, a Creepy Train engineer "Well, I intend to be the best wizard in

30
00:01:52.555 --> 00:01:53.316
the world!"

31
00:01:53.656 --> 00:01:54.377
Waldo said.

32
00:01:54.397 --> 00:02:00.813
"Ah-choo!" He sneezed loudly, sending a cloud of black bats into the air.

33
00:02:01.694 --> 00:02:05.036
Mr. Freaky stomped across the stage and frowned at Waldo.

34
00:02:05.056 --> 00:02:07.077
"You know the rules, Waldo.

35
00:02:07.577 --> 00:02:09.258
No spells during an assembly!"

36
00:02:09.278 --> 00:02:11.720
"Sorry. I have a cold.

37
00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:16.983
Ah-ah—" Waldo put his finger under his nose to stop another sneeze.

38
00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:21.345
"I'm not sure he has a cold," Winnie whispered to Ben.

39
00:02:21.365 --> 00:02:25.928
"He messed up in spell casting class yesterday.

40
00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.181
I think he put a spell on himself."

41
00:02:30.401 --> 00:02:32.301
Mr. Freaky tapped the microphone.

42
00:02:33.002 --> 00:02:36.743
"Welcome to Monster Academy's annual Career Day assembly.

43
00:02:37.283 --> 00:02:40.944
Our first guest today is Cleo's uncle Tut."

44
00:02:41.804 --> 00:02:43.525
Cheers filled the auditorium.

45
00:02:43.545 --> 00:02:49.506
"Woo-hoo!" The mummy strode proudly onto the stage.

46
00:02:49.526 --> 00:02:51.607
"Good morning.

47
00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:54.528
I used to be the king of Egypt."

48
00:02:55.996 --> 00:02:59.298
"I doubt I'll ever be a king," Mog whispered.

49
00:03:00.039 --> 00:03:00.899
Ben grinned.

50
00:03:00.919 --> 00:03:04.102
"You could be the Monster Prom king."

51
00:03:04.122 --> 00:03:08.284
"That's not a job," Mog replied.

52
00:03:09.385 --> 00:03:12.167
A lizard monster was the speaker after Uncle Tut.

53
00:03:12.187 --> 00:03:18.471
"I wrestle alligators and sell them at the market," he said.

54
00:03:19.712 --> 00:03:20.633
Gaby smiled.

55
00:03:20.653 --> 00:03:22.394
"I could do that job.

56
00:03:22.754 --> 00:03:23.735
You could too, Mog."

57
00:03:24.856 --> 00:03:26.777
"Nah." Mog shook his head.

58
00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:29.398
"I don't like getting my fur wet."

59
00:03:30.378 --> 00:03:32.299
The next presenter was a vampire.

60
00:03:32.319 --> 00:03:35.920
"I'm a bat groomer.

61
00:03:36.441 --> 00:03:41.443
As you know, bats go out every night and She paused to roll her eyes.

62
00:03:41.463 --> 00:03:45.344
"When they return at dawn, their hair is a mess!"

63
00:03:48.646 --> 00:03:51.667
Everyone laughed, which made Waldo sneeze again.

64
00:03:54.452 --> 00:03:56.453
The room filled with blue smoke.

65
00:03:57.833 --> 00:03:59.453
Mr. Freaky groaned.

66
00:03:59.473 --> 00:04:02.894
"I said no spells, Waldo."

67
00:04:03.615 --> 00:04:06.215
He pulled out a handkerchief to mop his forehead.

68
00:04:06.235 --> 00:04:09.396
"Please be on your best behavior, students.

69
00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:12.077
Our next guest doesn't like magic."

70
00:04:13.037 --> 00:04:15.918
The students clapped as Mayor Hubbletree strode in.

71
00:04:17.839 --> 00:04:19.199
He puffed out his chest.

72
00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:24.717
"As you know, I have a very important job.

73
00:04:25.537 --> 00:04:27.458
I'm the mayor of People Place.

74
00:04:27.978 --> 00:04:30.859
This position has a lot of responsibilities."

75
00:04:30.879 --> 00:04:33.219
"Like making Mr.

76
00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.720
Freaky miserable," Gaby whispered.

77
00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:42.302
"As mayor, I'm in charge of every part of People Place," Mayor Hubbletree went on.

78
00:04:42.322 --> 00:04:45.863
"I manage the parks and buildings.

79
00:04:46.243 --> 00:04:48.444
I make laws and run the government."

80
00:04:50.304 --> 00:04:53.385
He frowned at all the buckets lined up onstage.

81
00:04:53.405 --> 00:04:58.787
"And I make sure our schools are in good shape.

82
00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:04.508
As you can see, being mayor is the most important job of all."

83
00:05:04.528 --> 00:05:08.709
"Thank you for coming, Mayor Hubbletree," Mr.

84
00:05:08.749 --> 00:05:09.730
Freaky said quickly.

85
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.731
"I'm sure you have an important meeting to get to now."

86
00:05:13.691 --> 00:05:16.872
As the students applauded, the mayor spoke softly to Mr.

87
00:05:16.932 --> 00:05:20.669
Freaky. But Ben could hear his voice come through the microphone.

88
00:05:20.689 --> 00:05:24.450
"I'll talk to you later, Freaky," the mayor muttered.

89
00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.750
"It looks like we have a crisis here."

90
00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:29.471
"Crisis?" Ben thought.

91
00:05:30.031 --> 00:05:34.212
Before he could say anything to Winnie, the final guest scurried onto the stage.

92
00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:37.333
It was a dust collector carrying a broom.

93
00:05:37.893 --> 00:05:42.435
Waldo started sneezing again as clouds of dust drifted from the stage.

94
00:05:45.595 --> 00:05:47.576
The dust collector straightened his rags.

95
00:05:48.768 --> 00:05:51.809
"My job is very exciting," he said in a flat tone.

96
00:05:51.829 --> 00:05:53.429
"I collect dust.

97
00:05:54.069 --> 00:06:00.031
I begin sweeping at dawn and "Time for a nap," Mog whispered, shutting his eyes.

98
00:06:00.051 --> 00:06:03.392
"I'm not interested in dust collecting."

99
00:06:04.472 --> 00:06:07.333
Finally the dust monster was finished, and Mr.

100
00:06:07.413 --> 00:06:09.354
Freaky returned to the microphone.

101
00:06:09.374 --> 00:06:14.935
"I hope you enjoyed Career Day, students.

102
00:06:14.955 --> 00:06:20.311
We—" Just then the auditorium door banged open, and a skeleton clattered into the room.

103
00:06:20.832 --> 00:06:24.498
He had a long black beard and wore an eyepatch like a pirate.

104
00:06:25.399 --> 00:06:30.067
His other eye burned like fire as he waved a gleaming sword and snarled.

105
00:06:30.087 --> 00:06:31.910
"Give me all your gold!"
